=\"#\">Launch</a></li>\r\n            <li class=\"development-item\"><a href=\"#\">IT consulting</a></li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </aside>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<!-- Проекты -->\r\n<section class=\"projects\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"header-text\">\r\n        Developed more than <span class=\"text-color-blue\">100</span> projects in\r\n        <span class=\"text-color-blue\">15</span> industries\r\n    </h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"project-list\">\r\n        <article class=\"project-column\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"subheader-text\">Industries</h3>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>Social media</li>\r\n                <li>Fitness</li>\r\n                <li>Banking</li>\r\n                <li>Construction</li>\r\n                <li>Games</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <article class=\"project-column\">\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>Education</li>\r\n                <li>Transport</li>\r\n                <li>Medicine</li>\r\n                <li>Food delivery</li>\r\n                <li>Marketplaces</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <article class=\"project-column\">\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>AR</li>\r\n                <li>TV</li>\r\n                <li>Startups</li>\r\n                <li>Religion</li>\r\n                <li>Online courses</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n\r\n<section class=\"clients\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"header-text\">Projects we are proud of</h2>\r\n    <p class=\"default-text\">\r\n        Our company is proud of our clients. We enjoy long-term partnership.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <ul class=\"clients-list\">\r\n        <li><a href=\"#\">I-teka</a></li>\r\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Dauletten</a></li>\r\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Guru Bosch</a></li>\r\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Santo</a></li>\r\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Home Credit Bank</a></li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<h