y-about\">\r\n    <h3 class=\"header-text\">Our team</h3>\r\n    <p class=\"default-text\">\r\n        Full-cycle digital production with analytics, design, web and mobile dev.\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p class=\"default-text\">7 years in IT sphere, 100+ projects, 28 team members.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n\r\n<section class=\"faq\">\r\n    <h3 class=\"header-text\">FAQ</h3>\r\n    <details>\r\n        <summary>What is the cost of a mobile application?</summary>\r\n        <p>It depends on complexity, platform, and features.</p>\r\n    </details>\r\n    <details>\r\n        <summary>How long will development take?</summary>\r\n        <p>On average from 2 to 6 months.</p>\r\n    </details>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-content\">\r\n        <div class=\"footer-title\">IT WEBSITE</div>\r\n        <div class=\"footer-cols\">\r\n            <div class=\"footer-col\">\r\n                <img src=\"/src/assets/icons/IconPhone.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"footer-icon\">\r\n                <div class=\"footer-label\">Contact nums</div>\r\n                <div class=\"footer-value\">+7 (778) 395 90 26</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"footer-col\">\r\n                <img src=\"/src/assets/icons/IconEmail.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"footer-icon\">\r\n                <div class=\"footer-label\">Post</div>\r\n                <div class=\"footer-value\">mail@mail.com</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"footer-col\">\r\n                <img src=\"/src/assets/icons/IconGeo.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"footer-icon\">\r\n                <div class=\"footer-label\">Adress</div>\r\n                <div class=\"footer-value\">City city, steet st. 90</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"footer-col\">\r\n                <img src=\"/src/assets/icons/IconFile.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"footer-icon\">\r\n                <div class=\"footer-label\">Leave a request</div>\r\n                <div class=\"footer-value\">Leave a request</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\r\n            <img src=\"/src/assets/icons/Map.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"footer-bottom-icon\">\r\n            <span>We work throughout world</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</footer>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n
